{"name":"Pirate","title":"Pirate","revision":233547,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Pirate","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The aesthetic does get slight criticism due to the bad reputation of pirates in history. Though, the aesthetic itself does not value stealing and thieving. The community around this aesthetic instead value freedom, fairness, curiosity and balance. Loyalty is a large factor in Pirate, and a moral code is usually presented. They are interested in the unknown and the mysteries of the ocean, and believe in hard work and a strength of heart and mind."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pearls"},{"kind":"list","text":"Old/rusted coins and other gold trinkets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rocks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Corals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fossils"},{"kind":"list","text":"Waves"},{"kind":"list","text":"Marine skeletons/skulls"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sand"},{"kind":"list","text":"Vintage lockets and watches"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ships"},{"kind":"list","text":"Islands"},{"kind":"list","text":"Quills & ink"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hourglasses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Compasses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Keys"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sculptures relating to the sea"},{"kind":"list","text":"Seaweed"},{"kind":"list","text":"Coastal cliffs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ship wheels"},{"kind":"list","text":"Old gunpowder flintlock guns"},{"kind":"list","text":"Swords"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Decor"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Pirate design uses a lot of rustic, beachy, industrial and vintage elements. Examples include:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Strong emphasis on exposed pipe, metal and glass"},{"kind":"list","text":"Natural timber"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rustic or thrifted furniture"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blues and neutral colors usually with splashes of gold"},{"kind":"list","text":"Statues of marine animals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Victorian mirrors, chairs or architecture"},{"kind":"list","text":"Old looking photographs or sketches of the sea"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jars of coins, bones, gems or rocks"},{"kind":"list","text":"'Cabinets of curiosities' filled with fossils and marine skeletons on display"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Similar to Cottagecore, Dark Academia, and Adventurecore with some aspects of styles considered 'hippie' or 'boho'."},{"kind":"list","text":"Flowing maxi dresses"},{"kind":"list","text":"Corsets/corset belts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ruffles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Breathable layers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Oversized blouses or breathable tops"},{"kind":"list","text":"Neutral colors of blues, browns, reds, greens, ivory, etc."},{"kind":"list","text":"Tight or baggy pants"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flannels"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lace"},{"kind":"list","text":"Leather jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Oversized blazers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fingerless gloves"},{"kind":"list","text":"Heeled boots and sandals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Square belts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tricornes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Justacorps"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Accessories can vary but are usually scarves, beads, chains and handmade jewellery, and unlike the neutral colors of the clothing, will range from bright colours to metallics."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"A lot of pirate-esque music are modern shanties or maritime-based folk."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Genres"},{"kind":"list","text":"Traditional sea shanties/songs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Modern folk Folk-punk Folk-metal Indie folk"},{"kind":"list","text":"Alternative Indie Alternative rock"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Artists"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Skallywags"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Longest Johns"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Dreadnoughts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gorillaz (Plastic Beach album)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Storm Weather Shanty Choir"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flogging Molly"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Pogues"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Skullduggers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ye Banished Privateers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Alestorm"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Growlers"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Irish Rovers"},{"kind":"list","text":"fin"},{"kind":"list","text":"Soundtracks from games such as Sea of Thieves or Assassin's Creed 4: Black Flag"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Television"},{"kind":"list","text":"Treasure Island (multiple adaptations)"},{"kind":"list","text":"SpongeBob SquarePants (1999-present)"},{"kind":"list","text":"One Piece (1999-present)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Blackbeard (2006)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Marvelous Misadventures of Flapjack (2008)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jake and the Never Land Pirates (2011-2016)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Crossbones (2014)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Black Sails (2014-2017)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Santiago of the Seas (2020-23)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Lost Pirate Kingdom (2021)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Our Flag Means Death (2022-present)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Black Lagoon (2006)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fena: Pirate Princess (2021)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Granblue Fantasy: The Animation (2017-2020)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Movies"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Movies with visuals of oceans, boats, treasure or sea myths:"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jaws (1975)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Bounty (1984)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Splash (1984)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Princess Bride (1987)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Iguana (1988)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Waterworld (1995)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Titanic (1997)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Treasure Planet (2002)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Peter Pan (1953)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pirates of the Caribbean (2003)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sinbad (2003)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tinkerbell and the Lost Treasure (2009)"},{"kind":"list","